@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
state "구성 중 (Configuring)" as Configuring
state "활성 (Active)" as Active
[*] --> Configuring : gf_frame_create
Configuring : Runtime 소유
Configuring : load / add_capability
Configuring : validate / initialize_restart
Configuring --> Configuring : 활성화 실패\n(상태 보존)
Configuring --> Active : gf_frame_activate\n(Runtime을 한 번 이전)
Active : ScanDriver 소유
Active : gf_frame_scan
Active : load / add / activate 거부
Active --> Active : 스캔 실패\n(마지막 결과와 VM 상태 유지)
Configuring --> [*] : gf_frame_destroy
Active --> [*] : gf_frame_destroy
@enduml
